WEBVTT

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.580
Wait, owner.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.960
Hurry up.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:01:59.790
Okay.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.150
What are you doing?

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:05.500
I'm coming.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.410
What a beautiful view.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:13.610
From the second floor and up will be accommodations...

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:19.330
and this top floor will be a bar lounge for the casino guests to relax.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:23.760
But don't castles like this always have their share of scary ghost stories?

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:26.050
Really?

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:31.360
Don't worry about it. A ghost or two could be good for business.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:33.870
There are rumors of ghosts?

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:34.880
Who knows?

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.610
Let's check the basement next.

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:37.960
The basement?

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:39.620
Owner!

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:50.300
During the 19th Century, the last owner of this castle, Misery, ran a casino here.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.630
She is Misery.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:59.790
She's beautiful.

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:02.210
She is.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:10.570
Howard Resort has faithfully recreated the original casino here.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:14.020
The tables are the same as the ones we use at Howard Resort...

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.780
so the repairs were cheap.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.830
Amazing.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.210
Isn't it?

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:23.450
In order to complete the atmosphere for the guests...

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.900
change into the clothes I've prepared.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.920
How do you like this casino in a castle?

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:32.340
Don't you think it'll be superbly fun?

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:34.790
I could do without the ghosts.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.960
We'll open next week after the reconstruction is complete.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.630
I'm counting on you, Rio.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:43.490
But owner, I can't work here and at the casino in the hotel.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.890
I already don't get any time off because of everything you have me do.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:50.840
Don't worry. I've already acquired a new dealer.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.330
Another new recruit?

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.970
No, this one's experienced.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.580
I won't accept any mistakes.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.630
I've invested a tremendous amount of funds in this castle.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:05.050
If it doesn't succeed, it'll be a huge loss.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.180
Okay.

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:27.730
"Misery"

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.970
Good evening.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:06.720
20. Dealer showing 18.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.260
Congratulations.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.620
Let's make a bet.

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:18.370
If I win, I'll take your casino.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.950
You must be joking, ma'am.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.500
It was a dream...

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:59.210
I hate lightning!

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:24.910
Rio-chan, hold that smile.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.990
You're brilliant.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.460
You're radiant.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.040
Okay. Good work, Rio-chan.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.770
Thank you.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.690
Here, Rio. Good work.

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:54.950
Thanks.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.060
You're popular.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:05.880
Rosa-san!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.030
I'm sure you'll be getting a call from Hollywood any day now.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.170
I want to see a movie starring Rio!

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:14.770
Don't you agree, Choco?

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:16.250
Hey...

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.290
The lightning was intense last night.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.880
Was it? I slept well, so I didn't notice.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.990
Rio!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.820
Elle, Ille.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.030
Did you hear about yesterday's incident?

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.260
There's been an incident.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.520
What happened?

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.620
The wings.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:39.340
Wings.

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:42.950
Yesterday, the wings disappeared from a restaurant in the hotel...

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:43.770
during the night.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:44.650
During the night.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:45.840
The wings?

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:46.940
It's me.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.230
Sorry, but could you cancel my restaurant reservation?

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:50.620
Yes, please do.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.300
I gain weight even when I'm not eating.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.810
You're on a diet?

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:58.690
I was shocked when I woke up this morning.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.800
Well, I don't have an appetite.

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.930
Being an actress must be difficult.

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:05.700
I'm not just an actress. I'm a Hollywood actress.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.220
Have a lucky day.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:29.380
Hooray!

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:35.230
What?

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.520
Is it broken?

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.240
We've got terrible luck today.

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.120
Let's get going.

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:58.040
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:01.370
Here it is!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.160
Forget it. I've got terrible luck anyway.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.050
Sir!

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:11.260
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.010
Um...

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.170
Let's make a bet.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:36.430
If I win, I'll take this casino.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.410
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:47.800
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:56.790
The ball, the ball...

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.330
I'm terribly sorry, ma'am.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.120
Would you like something to drink over there?

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:01.970
No, thank you!

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:03.410
I found it!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.470
Ma'am!

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.700
If she wins, she'll take the casino...

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.300
Are you sure that's what she said?

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:42.310
Yes, Rio-senpai.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:46.800
What an arrogant woman.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.310
What did she look like?

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.190
I've never seen her before.

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:51.920
She was wearing a red dress...

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.270
A red dress?

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:55.850
She was beautiful, but there was something dark about her.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:58.930
Just like my dream...

00:10:58.930 --> 00:10:59.900
What dream?

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:02.510
Damn it, look at this.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.550
We can't see her face.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:10.770
Can't see it.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.190
It's a ghost...

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.350
Don't be ridiculous.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.900
She must have used an electromagnetic wave or jammer.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.560
That's why the power went out.

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:23.870
Tiffany, if this woman shows up again, call security immediately.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:25.220
Understood.

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:27.330
Ania.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.180
Yes?

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:29.810
Come with me.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.410
Rio-senpai, I'm scared.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.920
We'll be fine. Hold my hand.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.690
Why are the lights so dim?

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.290
The owner likes it.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.990
Yes, this is her!

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.690
Really? Take another good look.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:51.360
There's no mistake. It was her.

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:53.250
That means...

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.980
Who is she?

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.300
The ghost of Misery...

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:58.590
Ghost?

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:22.280
What is it?

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.060
Is it?

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.060
Do you hear that?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.160
Hear that.

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:14.740
You saw me!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:19.550
A ghost?

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.310
Yes, the ghost of Misery.

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:24.980
Ania confirmed it after looking at her portrait.

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.840
Owner!

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:31.680
I heard rumors of ghosts when I bought this castle.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.000
There's your confession.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:40.250
So what? There's no way ghosts exist.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.530
I did some research on Misery on the internet.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.060
Listen...

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.360
Misery loved gambling more than anyone else.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:55.430
The casino she opened in the castle was known for its beautiful lady owner. However...

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:01.240
A high roller played a game of craps...

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:07.590
In a single night, she lost everything...

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:10.600
from ownership of the castle to the wings.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:12.670
The wings?

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:15.160
Wings are Misery's favorite food.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.240
It coincides with the disappearance of the wings from the resort.

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:19.620
This is ridiculous.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:23.980
After Misery's death, the casino continued to operate under new ownership...

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:28.570
but Misery's ghost was sighted all over the place...

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:32.690
and the casino's rapid decline forced its eventual close.

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:33.410
Nonsense.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:34.760
Owner!

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.970
You're not going to do anything even with all this evidence?

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.540
What evidence?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.930
Let's suppose there really is a ghost.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:47.740
Why would an immaterial ghost want to eat wings?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.120
Because...

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.410
Why?

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.270
I don't know.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.990
I...

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.000
He's so hard headed.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.490
Rosa-san...

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.780
This is Rio.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.090
Hello?

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:47.270
Help me...

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:48.500
Rosa-san.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.290
Before I lose myself...

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.210
Rosa-san! Rosa-san!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.650
I gain weight even when I'm not eating.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.420
Misery's inside Rosa-san...

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.670
Rosa-san?

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.490
You're actress Rosa Canyon-san, aren't you?

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:37.470
I'm a huge fan. Please let me shake your hand.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.500
Rosa-san!

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.280
Rosa-san!

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:10.240
Welcome to my castle, Rio.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.010
You're Misery...

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.560
Release Rosa-san's body.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:19.230
Fine, but in exchange...

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.660
Let's play a game.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:29.030
If you win, I'll release Rosa. However, if you lose...

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.160
If I lose?

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:33.620
I will take Howard Resort.

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:34.970
Unacceptable!

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.890
I'll never accept those terms!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:39.080
Owner!

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.400
Elle, Ille!

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.890
These two forced me in here!

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:56.050
If you refuse, I'll cut him in two.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.060
Accept her challenge, Rio!

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:00.290
Are you sure you want to bet your resort?

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:01.110
No!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:02.900
But owner!

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:05.690
Fine, you have my permission!

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:06.670
I'll do it.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.920
Wait!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:08.930
Which is it?

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:10.500
I don't know!

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:16.500
If I win, will you really release Rosa-san?

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.470
I will.

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:20.460
You'll quietly return to your world.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:22.440
I promise.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.230
Now let's play.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.180
As you wish.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.840
Let's keep it simple.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.170
We'll bet on the sum of the dice coming up odd or even.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:43.200
Fine.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.690
Roll the dice.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:46.660
Okay.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.080
Roll the dice.

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:56.810
Which will you bet on?

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:57.910
Odd.

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:00.290
Don't lose, Rio!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:02.150
Howard Resort is my life!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:04.410
You have to win! That's an order!

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.090
What is she doing?

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.350
What's wrong? Roll the dice.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:23.980
Are you afraid to lose?

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.160
No, don't!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.170
Hurry.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:32.650
I can't do it!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.930
How spicy! What's wrong with these wings?

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:45.190
They should be spicy.

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:47.040
You!

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:51.350
I packed those wings with habanero.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.780
They vanished!

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.900
Release Rosa-san!

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.440
Rosa-san!

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.500
Stop it! Stop it!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:36.150
That was close.

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.500
Are you all right, Rosa-san?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.850
I'm fine.

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:44.410
I was just curious what it'd be like to be possessed by a ghost.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:47.610
Just like a Hollywood actress.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:51.010
She's the one who needs help.

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:02.760
Let me out of here!

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.210
That's an order!

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:07.210
Where did she go?

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.910
Thank you.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:29.650
You saved us, but...

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.410
I saw where things were headed.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.990
I guess that's what you'd call a dealer's intuition.

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:39.260
Dealer? You're the new dealer the owner hired?

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:41.460
It's good to see you again, Rio.

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:42.150
What?

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.140
Don't you recognize me?

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:47.530
Are you... Rina?

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:48.780
Yes, Rio!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:49.910
Rina!

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:28.500
Rina, thank you for saving us.

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:30.640
Let's be friends like we used to be.

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:34.000
Friends? We're not kids any more.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.510
You haven't changed.

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:39.400
"Sisters"

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:38.710
You can count on me in the next episode!
